+# AN-900: plan
+
+Each step is small and ends with passing tests. Mark a step `[x]` when it is done, in the same commit.
+
+- [x] 1. ADR-0017 for the event `identity.consent-changed` and the append-only record (files: `docs/adr/0017-consent-changed-event.md`, `docs/adr/README.md`)
+- [x] 2. T3-AC-004 tests for the record fields, the channels, unknown person, invalid input → `ConsentRecord`, `ConsentRepository`, `InMemoryConsentRepository`, `recordConsent` (files: `identity/consent.ts`, `identity/service.ts`, `identity/index.ts`, `identity/consent.test.ts`)
+- [x] 3. T3-AC-004 tests for a withdrawal, the current decision per purpose and the history → `currentConsent`, `consentHistory` (files: `identity/service.ts`, `identity/consent.test.ts`)
+- [x] 4. Event test → publish `identity.consent-changed` after the write (files: `identity/consent.ts`, `identity/service.ts`)
+- [x] 5. Table `identity.consent` with data metadata (files: `identity/schema.ts`)
+- [x] 6. Wire `InMemoryConsentRepository` into `createApp` and the existing identity test (files: `apps/worker/src/index.ts`, `identity/identity.test.ts`)
+- [x] 7. Update the module `AGENTS.md`. Run `/review`, then `pnpm check`.
+
+## Handoff
+
+Empty while one session works. `/handoff` writes here: the last finished step, the state of the next step, the next command.
